# Review 6 Nov 2026: was env/*.env, which let env/frontend.env.bak.<ts> (a full copy
# of the live secrets, written by scripts/set-google-oauth.sh) show up as untracked
# and be one `git add .` away from a commit. env/*.env* covers the env files and
# every backup or temp copy of them; only the examples are tracked.
env/*.env*
!env/*.env.example
# rclone config for the off-site bot backup (holds the remote's credentials).
env/rclone.conf
# Local bot database backups (scripts/backup-bot-db.sh): customer chats.
backups/
.env
*.log
